[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429695\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (all)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429696\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429587\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429593\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429604\">7040L40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429642\">7050A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429597\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429589\">7040G30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429594\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (side\non which to work)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429595\">7040H42</a>\n                                           (side\non which to work)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429591\">7040H10</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>It is not necessary to remove\nthe vehicle ceiling lining. Simply lower it to work on the aerial.\nIt is not therefore necessary to remove the front console with tunnel\ncover.</p></aside><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Aerial amplifier / feeder</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428744\">P25</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew the special nut with notched washer.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045080.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Working from the vehicle roof, recover the aerial base with cable.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045081.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the aerial is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Fit the cable, position the aerial base\nand secure from inside with a nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429591\">7040H10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429595\">7040H42</a>\n                                           (left\nside)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429594\">7040H38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429589\">7040G30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429597\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429642\">7050A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429604\">7040L40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429593\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429587\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429696\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429695\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (all)</p><p>Check to ensure the sound system  is working\nproperly.</p>"]]